## How It Works

```text
User
 ↓
Streamlit
 ↓
FastAPI
 ↓
 ├── Calorie Calculator
 ├── Qdrant Semantic Search
 └── RAG + Gemini
 ↓
Nutrition / Diet Recommendation
```

## Setup

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/indian-diet-ai.git
cd indian-diet-ai
```

### 2. Create virtual environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Windows:

```powershell
.\venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

### 3. Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. Configure environment variables

Create `.env`:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key
QDRANT_URL=http://localhost:6333
QDRANT_API_KEY=
API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

### 5. Run data ingestion

```bash
python backend/rag/ingestion.py
```

### 6. Start the backend

```bash
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
```

### 7. Start the frontend

```bash
streamlit run frontend/app.py
```

## API

| Endpoint                 | Method | Purpose            |
| ------------------------ | ------ | ------------------ |
| `/`                      | GET    | API status         |
| `/health`                | GET    | Health check       |
| `/api/calorie/calculate` | POST   | Calculate calories |
| `/api/food/search`       | GET    | Search food        |
| `/api/chat`              | POST   | Nutrition Q&A      |

